      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e61152c28521c5f",
      "translationZh": "我已发布 arcstone-continuity-core 的开源基线版本——这是一个零依赖、本地优先的运行时，旨在消除状态漂移和运维开销（Cₒₚₛ = 0）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbe154a3a50fd296",
      "translationZh": "故障时关闭的内存门控：在提交至内存之前，使用整数/定点缩放，在 O(1) 时间内依据不变量矩阵 Π(S) 对状态变更进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8135ee861e8ee05f",
      "translationZh": "严格的时间与内存限制：τ_override ≤ 11.99ms 的执行时间上限；固定的 4096 字节静态缓冲区。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13d04f2829ff4f42",
      "translationZh": "物理隔离与本地优先：执行绑定至回环接口（Data_Egress_Sensitive = 0），原生支持为本地 LLM/视觉模型摄取多模态剪贴板内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae3c698dc6b28c1b",
      "translationZh": "确定性的 5 级优先顺序：FAIL (POSIX 40) ≻ FREEZE (POSIX 10) ≻ PWC (POSIX 10) ≻ REFUSAL (POSIX 32) ≻ PASS (POSIX 0)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
